    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22754" root="شقر" body-key="$">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَقِرَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَقَرَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَقَرٌ</span> (M, L, Msb, K [in
the CK and TA <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَقْرٌ</span>, which is evidently wrong,])
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شُقْرَةٌ</span>, (Lth, K,) or the latter is a simple
subst.; (M;) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَقُرَ</span>; and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِشْقَرَّ</span></b> ; (M, K;) <i>He
was,</i> or <i>became, of the colour termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شُقْرَةٌ</span>. (M,
L, Msb, K.)

